-- Generated by hand from research: wiki product links point at the maker.
-- Playak links (a community site) are replaced by the maker's own page, an
-- archived snapshot of the maker's own site for a discontinued model, or NULL
-- when no maker page exists. Rows are matched by brand, model and the old URL
-- (ids differ in production). Only system-catalogue rows are touched.
UPDATE materials m SET product_url = v.new_url
FROM (VALUES
